{
  "uid": "cloudpipe-infra-health",
  "title": "CloudPipe — Infrastructure Health",
  "description": "Is the cluster keeping up? Argo controller throughput, Kubernetes API health, and how quickly Karpenter turns a pending pod into a running one.",
  "tags": [
    "cloudpipe",
    "infrastructure",
    "operations"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "CloudPipe dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "cloudpipe"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 900,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 🏗️ Is the machinery healthy?\n\nThis is about the **cluster**, not the science. Three things can go wrong:\n\n- **The controller falls behind** — work is queued faster than Argo can schedule it. Watch queue depth.\n- **The API server strains** — everything slows down at once. Watch p99 latency and error rate.\n- **Nodes arrive too slowly** — pods sit Pending while machines boot. Watch pod startup.\n\n**Empty panels are normal on an idle cluster.** Nodepool panels only show data while Karpenter-provisioned nodes exist; between batches the cluster runs on static nodes only, and those panels are legitimately blank."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Workflows running now",
      "description": "Argo workflows currently in Running phase.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Running\"})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pods waiting for a node",
      "description": "Pods in Pending. A non-zero value is normal during scale-up; a persistently high one means capacity is the bottleneck.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"argo-workflows\", phase=\"Pending\"})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Controller backlog",
      "description": "Argo controller workqueue depth — how many items are waiting to be reconciled. Sustained growth means the controller cannot keep up with submissions.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_queue_depth_gauge)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Slowest pod start (p99)",
      "description": "99th-percentile time from pod creation to running, as measured by Karpenter. Dominated by node boot and image pull on a cold node.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(karpenter_pods_provisioning_startup_duration_seconds_bucket[10m])) by (le))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 90
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 180
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "🔄 Argo workflow controller",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Controller restarts (1 h)",
      "description": "Restarts of the Argo workflow controller in the last hour. Anything above zero is worth investigating — an OOMKill here stalls every running workflow.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"argo-workflows\", container=\"controller\"}[1h]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Workflows by phase",
      "description": "Current number of Argo workflows in each phase over time.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 9,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "uid": "cloudpipe-prometheus",
        "type": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Running\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Running"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Pending\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Pending"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Failed\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Failed"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Error\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Error"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "sum(argo_workflows_gauge{phase=\"Succeeded\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Succeeded"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Running"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "blue",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "orange",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Succeeded"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
