      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Argo Controller CPU & Memory",
      "description": "Argo controller CPU (cores) and memory. Shown as absolute cores, not as a percentage of limit: this deployment sets no CPU request or limit at all, so there is no denominator to divide by. Memory is the working set.",
